[c6txidle] UART0 TX idle witness: a line loaded into the FIFO, the console flush,
[c6txidle] then the TX pad taken from the UART and held idle. The TAIL line below
[c6txidle] must end in its sentinel whole; a cut last byte is a flush that
[c6txidle] returned with the frame still shifting.
[c6txidle] TAIL 0123456789abcdef0123456789abcdef <<<TXIDLE-END>>>
[c6txidle] frame 86790 ns over 65 bytes, flush held 88120 ns past the FIFO's last byte (late past 4599870 ns)
[c6txidle] ST_UTX_OUT 0 after 10 ms quiet, 0 at the flush's return; idle is 0
[c6txidle] PASS the flush returned once the last frame had left
